# real models: the raw downloads are not in git (see scripts/assets and assets/models). The built files are not either, except those of the models a release
# carries (CC0, each pinned by hash in its manifest): they are committed as plain binaries (see .gitattributes), so a fresh clone can build and pack a release.
# A model held back from releases is never listed here.
